    "body": "I think you should be able to use the [negative matching feature](https://starship.rs/config/#negative-matching) to only match the correct module something like\n\n```diff\n[nodejs]\nformat = \"via [Node.js $version](bold italic cyan)\"\n+detect_files = [\"!bun.lockb\", \"!bunfig.toml\", \"package.json\", \".node-version\"]\n```\n\nI think we should change the default settings for the nodejs module to not trigger for bun projects. ",
